{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年65歲的昔日亞視一哥陳庭威，出身於TVB藝員訓練班，曾與梁朝偉在經典劇《新紮師兄續集》中合作。</p><p>其後他轉投亞洲電視（ATV），憑着《豪門》、《勝者為王》和《我來自潮州》等多部經典劇集，令事業登上高峰，加上其外形高大靚仔、斯文帥氣，成功虜獲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:21:57.629801+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.579903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.579903+00:00","content_hash":"c23af7a2402df4f9452c63b092220bd3737aadd7a16d8198136409de580c78a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}